, using nothing but your hands to get around.\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for something different in VR, this is it. ", "short_description": "Move like a gorilla in this VR game! Swing, climb, and leap through exciting maps using only your arms. Master the movement, explore, and compete\u2014simple controls, endless fun!"}]}, "developer_name": "Silence", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/206556d2-4ff9-41a6-a5bd-cdb453475b60", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Silence", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tamarin-lava-rush/start", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8818499534907423"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "472996545434705"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "472996545434705"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1735056000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "472996545434705"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "8909507595806616", "version": "10"}, "id": "1539089143449625", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typenam